# Board QA of 0.3.2, D7, at the board's density (see compact320.scene): the Wi-Fi / LAN page scrolled to where the "More options"
# header meets the hint under the list: a full gap of black between them, and the header whole. Nothing is sent.
# fake-scenario: notice
# expect-verbs: notices.take
# forbid-verbs: iface.outgoing, iface.enable
title Reticulum: the 480x320 board layout, a connection page
ppmm 633
sizes 480x320

wait 1500
key enter
wait 300
key home
key down
key down
key enter
wait 400
expect text "Wi-Fi LAN"
key enter
wait 400
shot wifi-top
expect text "connection: off"
expect whole "This kind of connection is on or off. While it is on, it may send."
# down through the options until the header "More options" is on the page
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
wait 300
shot wifi-mid
expect whole "MORE OPTIONS"
expect gap "MORE OPTIONS" "This kind of connection is on or off. While it is on, it may send." 4
key down
wait 300
shot wifi-mid2
key end
wait 300
shot wifi-end
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
key esc
expect quit
